    <!-- Usage notes -->
    <string name="usage_intro">Turn this on, and Gearslip sends a short note when you open it and after each drive. &lt;b&gt;The note holds no name, account, or location. A random number counts your phone once, and the server keeps no IP address.&lt;/b&gt; The notes show which cars work and where the others fail.</string>
